  m_Name: ElderlyHouse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  houseType: 1
  menuTitle: Older Resident
  choices:
  - choiceName: Wait for Notice
    carNumberMod: 0
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 0
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 0
    carLeaveTime: 2
    choiceDetail: 'No city-wide plan requests. Let residents make a decision when
      the evacuation notice goes out. '
    endGameFeedback: Older residents were caught off guard this time and waited for
      the evacuation notice before taking action. As a community, we need a better
      plan in place.
    isLocked: 0
    isNormal: 1
  - choiceName: Evacuate Early
    carNumberMod: 0
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 0
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 1
    carLeaveTime: 0
    choiceDetail: Evacuate early will allow for more time to get out safely. This
      is a good choice!
    endGameFeedback: 'A community plan to notify older residents was successful:
      those needing more time were able to evacuate early before the evacuation notice
      went out.'
    isLocked: 1
    isNormal: 0
  - choiceName: Help From Neighbor
    carNumberMod: -1
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 0
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 1
    carLeaveTime: 1
    choiceDetail: Getting help from a neighbor will be a great option! This will
      make evacuating both safer as well as quicker.
    endGameFeedback: Neighbors stepped in to help, offering rides to older residents
      who may have had trouble otherwise.
    isLocked: 1
    isNormal: 0
  longerTitle: Elderly Resident
  descriptions:
  - 'Older residents may need additional time and support to evacuate safely. It
    is very important to make plans in advance and consider multiple scenarios and
    consequences of choices. '
  - Some adult children and grand children choose to drive a great distance to pick
    up their elderly relative, but this can cause delays and additional congestion.
    Consider making a plan with a neighbor who can help them evacuate, or arranging
    to evacuate them early before there is an evacuation notice.
  carNumber: 1
  horseNumber: 0
  petNumber: 0
  kidNumber: 0
  carSpeed: 0
